# The package.json `files` allowlist is the published inventory, and it already
# wins over .gitignore — the generated sources ship because `files` names them,
# not because of anything here. This only guards the day `files` is removed:
# without it npm would fall back to .gitignore and drop every generated source,
# while nothing would stop the native archives or the tests going out.
*.zip
node_modules/
test/
